  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Rikka Sacred Queen Strenna",
      "effect": "2 Level 6 Plant monsters\nYou can detach 2 materials from this card; Special Summon 1 Plant Xyz Monster from your Extra Deck in Defense Position, except \"Rikka Sacred Queen Strenna\", then if you Special Summoned a \"Rikka\" Xyz Monster, you can attach 1 \"Rikka\" monster from your Deck to it. If a monster(s) is Tributed (except during the Damage Step): You can Set 1 \"Rikka\" Trap from your Deck or GY. You can only use each effect of \"Rikka Sacred Queen Strenna\" once per turn."
    },
    "ja": {
